{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"中電和港燈明年分別加電費1.8%及7.9%\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/ELECT-FEE-261124-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】中電及港燈明年起分別加電費1.8%及7.9%。</p><p>目前電費由基本電價及燃料調整費組成，受國際油價波動影響，中電及港燈的燃料調整費現時已較今年初升超過兩成及五成，當中港燈燃料費升幅較大，由1月的每度電35.4仙，升到11月的55.1仙。</p><p>兩電近日已公布會撥出款項，為基層提供電費補貼及支援節能措施等。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.336552+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:08:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:37:15.024161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:29.268248+00:00","content_hash":"9e693e08219ecaecae78260f9be4f02681a20a67e9aaef9a0a8bbd0a87ead831","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.336552+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}